[{"title":"月夜赴郡会归辗转不成寐触事感怀口占四古句 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"槎牙两榕木，偃蹇江之濆。\n虽缘拥肿废，幸免寻斧斤。\n东家不鸣雁，喑默存其神。\n事固不一概，雁烹木长春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30500,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜赴郡会归辗转不成寐触事感怀口占四古句 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"连云峙华屋，东隅满荆棘。\n延缘耗地利，狼藉窥空壁。\n一朝火燎原，根枝荡无迹。\n蔓除亦可喜，火烈忧转剧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30501,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜赴郡会归辗转不成寐触事感怀口占四古句 其四","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"骑猎似为业，养鹰如养儿。\n人言鹰玩兔，主翁鼎镬之。\n玩兔信不忠，九死固其宜。\n万一疑似间，群鹰惊欲飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30502,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺判府生子","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"西江最上流，南安古名城。\n庾山蔚然秀，章水浏其清。\n异代得伟人，分此风月平。\n往者程伯温，关决烨有声。\n煌煌万金产，烱烱双珠明。\n四海名父子，一门佳弟兄。\n造诣极洙泗，叩击铿英茎。\n流风已百载，今日复一程。\n提屏东方来，宽令孚群氓。\n名门衍馀庆，兰玉添新荣。\n山川萃神秀，穹垕储精英。\n仲律青阳熙，五夜璧月盈。\n天上双麒麟，刚欲逐队行。\n抱送者释氏，协梦兮长庚。\n昔为程氏子，俱以斯道鸣。\n今为陈家儿，岐嶷由天成。\n觅公洗儿钱，我不学世情。\n期公爱子深，视厥程先生。\n器质待涵养，门户须支撑。\n会看三世间，接踵当拒衡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30503,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"之官过赣滩 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"玉局诗中皇恐滩，闻之已为骨毛寒。\n那知舞索并天柱，更向前头作怒澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30504,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"之官过赣滩 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"滩声嘈杂怒轰雷，顽石参差拨不开。\n行客尽言滩路崄，谁教君向崄中来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30505,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨霁报谒见一鹭得鱼群鹭争食之 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"一鹭翩翩傍钓矶，隔汀群鹭已知机。\n空将辛苦供群吻，毕竟贪鱼罪有归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30506,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨霁报谒见一鹭得鱼群鹭争食之 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"履崄窥鱼得几何，傍来攫取较多多。\n争如敛翼餐馀粟，犹在人间洁白科。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30507,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿曾佥判 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"渐报星桥铁锁开，游仙失脚下蓬莱。\n一番春色归桃杏，半吐歌唇献寿杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30508,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿曾佥判 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"陆地新开万朵莲，綵云拥出幕中仙。\n傅岩已入春宵梦，火急排云叶九天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30509,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杜子野湛泉诗来诗有尘事分清事之句","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"榕阴漠漠俯清泉，泉溜涓涓不计年。\n未必尘纷败佳思，凭栏得句却天然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30510,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子野又以诗来言不画涪翁画李翁再和之","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"太守一时留惠爱，诗仙万古自清风。\n寻常藻绘初何记，终是人心记此翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30511,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻鸦有感","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"鹊群饶舌本何功，鸦阵狂言却似忠。\n闻鹊忻然鸦辄唾，甘谀易售古来同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30512,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读杨妃传","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"六宫粉黛溢三千，一个中间宠爱专。\n自此世情生妄想，推排妃子作神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30513,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾氏清江亭","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"想得当年月浸扃，诸公翰墨此纵横。\n亭荒久矣诗亡恙，一道长江万古清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30514,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜子野寄云山兰石四画且以近诗来和韵酬之 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"石瘦兰馨入骨寒，笔端往往带儒酸。\n河阳桃李春风满，此段烦君更画看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30515,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜子野寄云山兰石四画且以近诗来和韵酬之 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"爱君标格碧峰清，为辍床头竹叶瓶。\n想得醉馀锋颖健，群鹅端欲博黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30516,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杜宰送茶韵 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"谁遣持书昼打门，茶魁有句牧之孙。\n煎调还我西江手，水茗相投自不浑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30517,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杜宰送茶韵 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"月团不遣贡脩门，却寄书痴闭户孙。\n若把焦坑分品第，浚功端合逊王浑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30518,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜子野惠来禽内碧桃谢以一绝","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"五色云笺到冷曹，更将果实饱诗饕。\n便应谱入来禽内，青李刊除着碧桃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30519,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子野惠竹?有感而赋二绝 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"玉局诗中曾识面，小山书后忽题名。\n鸱夷混沌俱惭逊，更胜河豚大瘦生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30520,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子野惠竹?有感而赋二绝 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"食根为?肥腰腹，食实为凰长羽毛。\n同是此君供廪饩，居然地位判卑高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30521,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"矫矫雄张虎欲奔，低低蹲伏雁成群。\n丁宁莫碍行舟过，唤作长生万石君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30522,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"初疑万马立沙汀，又似临流簇戍兵。\n激怒滩声能许劣，终宵长泄不平鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30523,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"漱崖啮石出奇功，浴月涵风淡荡中。\n过者千帆闹如织，会心知有几人同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30524,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其四","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"乘车山径苦崎倾，舟涉飞湍石胆惊。\n等是危途休计较，此心无碍尽堪行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30525,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其五","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"北来快顺一篙駃，南去间关百丈牵。\n世事从来且如许，下滩船看上滩船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30526,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其六","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"岭海脂膏自古传，至今来往共长川。\n灵灵有眼还知道，几个归人月满船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30527,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其七","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"江清端可乐朝饥，崄处行人尽得知。\n平陆波涛良叵测，崄中却自是平夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30528,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其八","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"闻道春江潋滟时，滩平如掌棹如飞。\n何时满却葵丘戍，流水桃花送客归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30529,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其九","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"十八滩头一叶身，山川曾识旧词臣。\n诗魂百载犹苏醒，应笑风波解戏人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30530,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二十一日重过赣滩十绝句 其十","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"储潭初发未朝餐，一日经行十八滩。\n不似来时推不进，吟诗把酒傲惊湍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30531,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐陵试院次陈明叔韵","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"晓看窗影过飞鸦，短发蓬松一半斜。\n两月不遨直瘦却，梦寻庾岭访梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30532,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"旧传庾岭梅花好，及到梅关少见梅。\n唯有一般差可信，南枝长占小春开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30533,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观钓","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"热犹造请褦襶子，老未知休矍铄翁。\n立懦廉顽今几见，桐江梦想一丝风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30534,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"府判社日招饮蒋园座中索赋诗三绝句 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"玉妃围坐簇娉婷，勾引阳和媚德星。\n洗尽凡花脂粉气，月香亭是雪香亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30535,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"府判社日招饮蒋园座中索赋诗三绝句 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"城西好事主人家，走送天香国色花。\n岭阯三年才见此，便应奴婢命山茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30536,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"府判社日招饮蒋园座中索赋诗三绝句 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"柳丝摇曳春风里，山色空濛社雨中。\n领略韶华拚一醉，巴歌聊尔效南翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30537,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再续前韵 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"莺谷声喧雨乍晴，邦人引领望屏星。\n阳和一气元无际，小为寻花到野亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30538,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再续前韵 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"荷囊清白旧传家，来看溶溶月下花。\n不似寻常杀风景，也宜饮酒也宜茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30539,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再续前韵 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"笔端鸾凤诗千首，社下鸡豚酒一钟。\n九十日春今强半，典衣还忆少陵翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30540,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依前韵呈府判 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"城南烟雨趁春耕，遥指屏星是福星。\n肯学晋人耽燕乐，只因修禊会兰亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30541,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依前韵呈府判 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"占籍蓬莱第一家，劝农莳稻莫莳花。\n时和不但歌华黍，墙有柔桑焙有茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30542,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依前韵呈府判 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"发舒生意烟花外，酝酿丰年雨意中。\n关决郡条知有助，故应千里化文翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30543,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月香亭主人送似牡丹座客作芍药品题 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"素妆芍药万花王，叶未全舒满国香。\n醉眼梦腾浑不醒，虎贲却似蔡中郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30544,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月香亭主人送似牡丹座客作芍药品题 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"玉容当配水仙王，压尽群花不敢香。\n昼困未苏酣宿雨，也疑汤饼试何郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30545,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"横江江上四山环，少得当前面势宽。\n试上此堂舒远目，疏林尽处见峰峦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30546,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"大峰舒肆小峰崷，帘幕中间坐五侯。\n立断斜阳吟不透，一声牧笛满林秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30547,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"竹篱茅店野人家，门外清流一带斜。\n小隐桃溪端的是，更须水上觅胡麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30548,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其四","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"比屋桑麻三月雨，夹溪桃李四时春。\n谁欤幻出山前景，指似堂中觅句人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30549,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其五","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"自有堂来三换扁，官居贤否只山知。\n酴醾妩媚今何许，山色青妍宛旧时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30550,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其六","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"客问主人今暇否，主人心与水云閒。\n庭空吏散文书静，茗椀熏炉上爱山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30551,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爱山堂七绝句 其七","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"坡谷经行久品题，顾令迂拙强搜诗。\n虽然何世无坡谷，山立孤高好自持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30552,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠琴士翁明远并简干教二黄丈 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"钟期不作伯牙死，琴堕云烟莽苍中。\n翠玉楼前几识子，山风吹散又西东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30553,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠琴士翁明远并简干教二黄丈 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"莫恨吾琴难入俗，俗人不听韵方高。\n?筝耳畔休拈出，韶石亭前走一遭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30554,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠琴士翁明远并简干教二黄丈 其三","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"静寄琴中适意吟，鲁庵句里自然琴。\n琴诗苦要清如许，千古寥寥觅赏音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30555,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠琴士翁明远并简干教二黄丈 其四","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"我亦能琴妙不传，无琴无谱并无弦。\n客来问讯琴安在，指似孤鸿落日边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30556,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章贡三咏 其一 郁孤台","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"群山涌浪翠周遭，中峙层台气象豪。\n万里阙庭长在望，定应天眼照孤高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30557,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章贡三咏 其二 郁孤洞天","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"崇山脩竹小兰亭，人在云烟深处行。\n环立千竿了清绝，中盘一径巧纡萦。\n纷纷雁鹜庭堆案，扰扰蝇蜗市有声。\n洞里道人忘底事，小桥西畔句初成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30558,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章贡三咏 其三 翠玉楼","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"梦跨长虹海上游，寒生肌骨一壶秋。\n好风吹得时魂醒，自寄云间翠玉楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30559,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上判府陈秘丞 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"斗大山州枕上流，蓬山仙客此遨游。\n读书竹屋公多暇，乐业江郊民有秋。\n泮藻丛边深长育，岭梅香里费赓酬。\n有人来问和羹味，太守忘言一笑休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30560,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上判府陈秘丞 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"向来一榻下南州，此事无传阅几秋。\n顾我风流非孺子，乃今天幸事王侯。\n颓波甚矣谁能返，砥柱岿然好镇浮。\n唤起东湖风月梦，请为榱桷备兼收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30561,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬温户见和首篇","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"南来冠盖总名流，契合全忘是宦游。\n清甚夜寒金井露，瑩于霜晓玉壶秋。\n梅关景物诗陶写，莲幕风流酒劝酬。\n只恐乌罗留不住，汉庭山立看扬休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30562,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬陈太庾 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"后来令尹职承流，君亦牛刀岭阯游。\n和气满城桃醉雨，仁风四野麦先秋。\n陈玄谱在交逾固，毛颖功多赏未酬。\n抚字劳心古如此，不须为米便归休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30563,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬陈太庾 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"英声猎猎满山州，翠剡飞来鹗在秋。\n父母视民非俗吏，子男分土列诸侯。\n篇诗捲送骊珠烂，杯酒相从蜡味浮。\n不必即人人即我，定知瑚琏合当收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30564,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬何学宾 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"商山黄绮信清流，自合相从鹤禁游。\n邺架烂观三万轴，庄椿行老八千秋。\n高怀莫遣群儿觉，佳句那无半语酬。\n我亦诸侯老宾客，更将墨守问何休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30565,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬何学宾 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"昔闻鼻祖在扬州，诗句清于玉露秋。\n奕世相承忻有后，在家还复胜封侯。\n观颐义熟灵龟见，祝寿杯深绿蚁浮。\n丹凤休衔丹诏下，黄冠已懒待黄收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30566,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬曾学录王掌祠 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"夫君砥柱屹中流，也肯来为泮水游。\n好句上摩周雅颂，褒词荣过鲁春秋。\n高山忽奏音逾古，美玉深藏价未酬。\n搜遍枯肠难论报，江淹聊欲拟阳休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30567,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬曾学录王掌祠 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"去年射策古杭州，来到梅关岁已秋。\n德薄岂堪仪众俊，贫躯聊复客诸侯。\n一窗灯火味清苦，四座风流酒拍浮。\n弟子无非梁栋用，先生未必副先收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30568,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬张录南老 其一","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"词源倾写峡江流，曾蹋槐花月里游。\n梅岭诗篇一瓯雪，芹宫书册四山秋。\n明珠小借枯崖润，美玉那无善价酬。\n再战定穿三级浪，丝鞭席帽拜新休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30569,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬张录南老 其二","author":"徐鹿卿","text":"生长西江帝子州，蟪蛄强欲语春秋。\n溉根正喜逢张籍，拾芥宁堪拟夏侯。\n冷淡工夫千兔秃，飘零踪迹一萍浮。\n自量只合山林住，乌幕如何也见收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":30570,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]